 Most significant for Beethoven's career as a composer are the three
planets VENUS,JUPITER and PLUTO, high in the sky, and URANUS ascending
within one and a half degrees. We have here two                             mighty midpoint­
combinations : VENUS /JUPITER - MC       PLUTO. VENUS in the Xth house
symbolizes music; its effect is strengthened by the above mentioned MC
and PLUTO. However, composition of music depends very much on ingenui­
ty, which is here symbolized by the ascending URANUS. Although the com­
posing of music is based on ingenuity and intuition, it is closely attached
to everything that we attribute to science.                 As the structure of notes and
their Intervals follows strict mathematical rules (proportions), this art
which we call music      differs greatly from the art which is produced by
novelists, scriptwriters and poets.
In this case NEPTUNE, the planet of phantasy and illusion, supported by
Mercury and/or Jupiter is characteristic for their talent and success.


